      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nG0EpiWyPWvJzx3KQ_15GG_FzGT0hbcj3euHP22vg=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Love Curacao- my favorite island in the Caribbean- was there in 2017- can’t wait to make it back there again soon",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-27T03:02:43Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "Ugx6tJE8NkDMNL07ZXJ4AaABAg.AbF6BC306VpAbKDEZNVZbw",
          "author": "@stephenminter2714",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nG0EpiWyPWvJzx3KQ_15GG_FzGT0hbcj3euHP22vg=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "All of the above - but mainly it is how the people of the island, with their various backgrounds and heritages have managed to create this beautiful mosaic of a culture - the people there seem to have figured out how to make their diversity their greatest strength- the way that the people share each other’s languages and foods and music is so unique- I don’t know if I’ve seen it anywhere else in the world",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-09-29T02:40:33Z"
        },
